Init python venv: python3 -m venv venv
Activate venv: 
- Linux: source venv/bin/activate
- Windows: ./venv/Scripts/activate
Install requirements: pip install -r requirements.txt
Run the script: python3 scraping/organigram_scraper.py

Start docker with neo4j db: docker-compose up -d 
Creates folder neo4j with subfolders config, data, logs, plugins
Credentials can be found in the docker-compose.yml file

See neo4j browser at: http://localhost:7474/browser/preview/
